: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/31f7f899/9/code.py:386:    ascending_only = _ascending_filtered_output(g)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/31f7f899/9/code.py:387:    no_filter = _naive_no_filter_output(g)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/31f7f899/9/code.py:393:        \"distractors_change_output\": int(not np.array_equal(fused, no_filter)),\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/14/code.py:387:    Key insight: The nested magenta frames do not just filter static reachability. Their openings create a sequence of locked annuli, and maroon gates must be removed in BFS layers before farther maroons can even become candidates.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7c66cb00/9/code.py:263:    Dock two-tone sprites into color-matched horizontal bars with a color swap.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/10/code.py:125:      - accepted samples are filtered by explicit competition metrics\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/58490d8a/4/code.py:88:    - The stable signal is the legend's color list: outside shape diversity and multi-color clutter are both distractions, so the task reduces to color-filtered connected-component counting.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7c66cb00/10/code.py:20:    - The grid is still 30x24 with 2-3 horizontal bars near the bottom, but every bar\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7c66cb00/10/code.py:266:    - The lower portion contains 2-3 centered horizontal bars that do not span the full\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/27/code.py:114:# Colors were pre-filtered so that the fused metrics stay non-degenerate.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/da515329/45/code.py:88:#     acceptance filtering removes samples whose density is too low or whose launches\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7c66cb00/19/code.py:152:    - The lower portion contains 2-3 full-width horizontal bars whose rows have the pattern\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/58490d8a/22/code.py:63:#   - Distractor colors are visually similar in density, so the legend must be used as the filter for which\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/58490d8a/22/code.py:416:    - The stable signal is the legend's color list, not sprite shape or raw blob count: first filter to the key colors, then split each color's outside pixels with 4-neighbor connectivity before writing the tally dots.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/da515329/27/code.py:43:#    alone. The accepted samples are filtered to ensure two measurable signatures:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7c66cb00/4/code.py:203:    - The lower region contains 2-3 full-width horizontal bars, each with one fill color\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/31f7f899/14/code.py:25:#   several empty horizontal holes of equal thickness. Each hole has a same-colored marker strip\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/31f7f899/14/code.py:50:#   bg holes inside a separate frame, and their identity is read from external marker strips.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/31f7f899/14/code.py:58:#   (one source bar, one marker strip), every hole has one marker strip immediately left of the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/31f7f899/14/code.py:80:#   Generator makes the frame far larger than any source bar or marker strip.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/31f7f899/14/code.py:83:# - `_extract_holes()` assumes every enclosed bg cavity has a unique non-bg marker strip on the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/58490d8a/6/code.py:161:    Key insight: The legend still provides the color-to-row index, but each indexed color now undergoes a fused transformation: its outside instances disappear and their count is rewritten inside the box as a solid horizontal bar.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/24/code.py:12:1. D11/1 color filtering:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/24/code.py:87:  observed failure is genuinely caused by color filtering, not by a hidden geometric choke.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7c66cb00/5/code.py:241:    - The bottom region contains 2-3 full-width horizontal bars; different bars may share the same fill color, but each (fill, border) pair is unique.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7c66cb00/13/code.py:175:    - The lower region contains 2-3 full-width horizontal bars with a fill color and edge border color.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/da515329/3/code.py:51:#     - Accepted samples are filtered by solver success, determinism, fill range, and a direction-gap metric.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7c66cb00/6/code.py:18:# - Base scene: bottom horizontal bars, top detached sprites made from bar fill\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7c66cb00/6/code.py:106:    \"\"\"Detect full-width horizontal bars and annotate height parity.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7c66cb00/6/code.py:187:    filtered = [pat for pat in patterns if int(pat[\"outer_color\"]) in fill_to_bar]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7c66cb00/6/code.py:189:        filtered,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7c66cb00/6/code.py:275:    - The lower region contains full-width horizontal bars; each bar has a fill\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7c66cb00/6/code.py:539:    \"\"\"Render input and both fused / legacy outputs for filtering.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/18/code.py:179:      horizontal bar whose full bottom edge is solid and whose evenly spaced upward teeth define the active columns.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7c66cb00/14/code.py:11:#       count: 2-3 full-width horizontal bars in the lower area\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7c66cb00/14/code.py:323:    Repeatedly dock grouped two-blob sprites through a color-link chain of horizontal bars.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/37/code.py:56:     3. Red reflector components are thin horizontal bars adjacent to bounce states.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/26/code.py:66:      smaller horizontal bar with upward projections.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7c66cb00/12/code.py:19:#   full-width horizontal bars stacked in the lower half, with many more sprites than\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7c66cb00/12/code.py:284:    - The lower zone contains 4-5 full-width horizontal bars, each with a fill color and\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/da515329/32/code.py:212:    \"\"\"Quantify the core fused behaviors for generator filtering and post-run audits.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b99e7126/25/code.py:47:   - Minority masks are filtered to be asymmetric under every non-zero quarter-turn and to differ\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/24/code.py:94:    - Grey forms two disconnected components: a rectangular frame on the right and a horizontal bar with four upward projections on the left.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/da515329/15/code.py:59:#     - Candidate centers are filtered so the large cross never overlaps template cells.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b99e7126/47/code.py:41:#     unique, and the chosen source is determined only by position after boundary filtering.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b99e7126/47/code.py:64:#     first special cell overall; a border-filtered choice is always required.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/11/code.py:86:    - A grey structural color forms two main components: a large frame on the right whose opening is on the top edge, and a smaller horizontal bar on the left whose full base is its top row and whose four teeth extend downward.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b99e7126/31/code.py:82:#   minority subset. `_choose_given_subset()` filters for that exactly.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/26/code.py:33:    - 原 generator 的 `_checkerboard`、`(r+c+1)%2` 恢复规则、偶相位 placement filter 都依赖\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/20/code.py:39:#       recovers the canonical horizontal bar; mirroring then reverses the height\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/da515329/2/code.py:76:#      exist, so generate_input() filters for a minimum red fraction and a minimum number of visible\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/332f06d7/16/code.py:76:    generator_filters:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/2/code.py:84:    - The dominant background surrounds two grey components: a top-open U-frame lower on the right and a smaller horizontal bar hanging above that opening.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b99e7126/1/code.py:50:#    and every subset is filtered so the macro placement is unique.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/da515329/10/code.py:37:#    the board, then filters to centers whose nearest tip is unique. For the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/23/code.py:103:#       non-legend marker after filtering, and generate_input guarantees that.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/23/code.py:127:#     - main assumes at least one real marker remains after legend filtering; the generator always places several.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/10/code.py:158:    - The background dominates the 8x20 canvas, while grey forms two disconnected structures: an open frame on the right and a toothed horizontal bar on the left.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b99e7126/37/code.py:79:#      the center anchor of its own local 3x3 coarse block. Generator filters masks to ensure\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/25/code.py:272:    \"\"\"Generate all valid blob specs, optionally filtered by port direction, in shuffled order.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/16/code.py:11:#      is now a suspended midair chamber with multiple floating horizontal bars. The solver no longer\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/16/code.py:18:#      * inside the chamber, the first horizontal bar blocks the direct route downward, so the BFS\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/16/code.py:208:      chamber, and suspended horizontal bars inside that chamber.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/da515329/5/code.py:48:#    layers are avoided. The generator filters out nearly empty placements.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/23/code.py:330:    filtered_pieces: list[dict],\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/23/code.py:335:    selected = [p for p in filtered_pieces if p[\"id\"] in selected_ids]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/23/code.py:386:        filtered_pieces = [rec for rec in all_pieces if not _is_inner_noise(rec, cand[\"bbox\"])]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/23/code.py:390:            for rec in filtered_pieces\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/23/code.py:396:        frame_area = sum(rec[\"area\"] for rec in filtered_pieces if rec[\"id\"] in frame_ids)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/23/code.py:400:        scatter = [rec for rec in filtered_pieces if rec[\"id\"] not in frame_ids]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/23/code.py:412:                if sum(rec[\"area\"] for rec in filtered_pieces if rec[\"id\"] in selected_ids) != target_area:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/23/code.py:415:                    return _candidate_subset_solve(filtered_pieces, selected_ids, cand).astype(int)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/23/code.py:419:    raise AssertionError(\"no valid two-stage filtered assembly found\")\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/da515329/6/code.py:67:#     - Candidate centers are filtered by solved outputs: every branch must be long enough to\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/4/code.py:96:    - Grey forms two disconnected objects: a right-side frame and a left-side horizontal bar whose four projections rise from alternating base columns.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/31/code.py:393:    \"\"\"Generate all valid cross specs, optionally filtered by hidden-port direction.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/29/code.py:125:      - If there are full horizontal bars of length W-2 in the input, use them as the top/bottom edges\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/5/code.py:149:    - The background and a single grey structural color form two separated objects: a large right-hand half-open frame and a detached horizontal bar with four upward projections.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/12/code.py:34:#      least one overflowing decoded placement. That makes the \"decode first, then filter by fit\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/12/code.py:279:      step is to filter out edge-near decodings whose glyph would overflow.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/da515329/34/code.py:30:#    - The generator filters for multiple turns per spiral and for a nontrivial visible delta against the same\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b99e7126/32/code.py:374:    Key insight: The anomaly is not “the rarest bitmap” and not even “the globally rarest shape” — normal tiles advertise themselves by a common internal symmetry, and only after filtering by that symmetry does the shared non-symmetric source shape emerge as the fractal template.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/8/code.py:204:    spec_filter: Callable[[dict], bool] | None = None,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/8/code.py:213:            if spec_filter is not None and not spec_filter(spec):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/8/code.py:675:    spec_filter: Callable[[dict], bool] | None = None,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/8/code.py:686:    for spec in _all_specs(spec_filter=spec_filter):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/8/code.py:726:    spec_filter: Callable[[dict], bool] | None = None,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/8/code.py:737:    def blocker_filter(spec: dict) -> bool:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/8/code.py:740:        return True if spec_filter is None else spec_filter(spec)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/8/code.py:742:    for spec in _all_specs(port_dir=entry_side, spec_filter=blocker_filter):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/8/code.py:826:        spec_filter=_seed_spec,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/8/code.py:842:        spec_filter=_double_hit_spec,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/8/code.py:859:            spec_filter=_partial_terminal_spec,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/da515329/13/code.py:81:#     candidate is built in-bounds, solved by the combo solver, and filtered by fill,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b99e7126/28/code.py:32:#    learnable from a few examples. Generator masks are filtered so both the source-stage variants and the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b99e7126/6/code.py:24:#     reliably identify the class after generator filtering.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/aa4ec2a5/24/code.py:74:#     - The generator explicitly filters for samples that contain all six meaningful colors and enough\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b99e7126/14/code.py:145:      color-inversion filter.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e3721c99/25/code.py:237:      - component does not touch the outer grid border (filters dividers).\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b99e7126/13/code.py:51:#    - Center combinations are pre-filtered so at least one overlap exists, but no coarse\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/31/code.py:39:#     - Original optional anchor heuristics (corners, horizontal bars, paired vertical lines) assumed input geometry\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/31/code.py:62:#         3. every piece is a filled horizontal bar of height 1,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/34/code.py:61:#    - The variant-gap filter compares the combo solver against a bidirectional baseline on the same\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/15/code.py:175:    \"\"\"Generate all valid blob specs, optionally filtered by port direction.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b99e7126/46/code.py:60:#    `_gen_attempt()` checks all of these indirectly via `main(inp) == out` and directly via subset filters.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b99e7126/23/code.py:55:#       down one placement. Generator filters subsets for that property.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/aa4ec2a5/37/code.py:34:#      longer true, so the area filter must happen before hole recoloring.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/44/code.py:60:#     two short horizontal bars, two matching vertical side bars, and one central bar.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/25/code.py:58:# - Original `comp_colors` filtering is no longer valid because a color may\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/aa4ec2a5/35/code.py:496:def _make_filtered_hollow(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/aa4ec2a5/35/code.py:656:        \"left_support\": _make_filtered_hollow(max_w=LEFT_SUPPORT_MAX_W),\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/aa4ec2a5/35/code.py:657:        \"left_conflict\": _make_filtered_hollow(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/aa4ec2a5/35/code.py:661:        \"right_hollow\": _make_filtered_hollow(max_w=RIGHT_HOLLOW_MAX_W),\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/21/code.py:16:#   - D14 is resolved here as a fixed orientation filter: only markers whose inferred outward row\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/80a900e0/21/code.py:191:      direction, and activation is a second filter based only on whether that direction points upward.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/26/code.py:611:    # not routing subnetworks and should not erase D20 coverage during filtering.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/24/code.py:139:    Repack scattered horizontal bars into a dense rectangle whose stripe order is mirror-symmetric top-to-bottom.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/24/code.py:142:    - The dominant color is background; every remaining component is a solid horizontal bar.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/24/code.py:165:        assert band[\"w\"] >= band[\"h\"], \"pieces must be horizontal bars, not tall columns\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/10/code.py:558:    Solving now requires combining branching and direction filtering: the green bars tell you every possible exit, but only one entrance side is valid, so the final red network is a selective BFS tree rather than an unconditional chain.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/9/code.py:380:    raise AssertionError(\"no frame candidate yields a valid noise-filtered assembly\")\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b99e7126/5/code.py:32:#    from a few examples. The generator filters masks so all four rotations are distinct; this\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/3/code.py:33:#         the same quadrant inventory, rather than as unrelated post-filters.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/12/code.py:220:                    filtered = [pos for pos in opts if int((pos[1] - cc) * overflow_dir) > 0]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/12/code.py:221:                    if len(filtered) == 1:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/12/code.py:222:                        opts = filtered\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/aa4ec2a5/2/code.py:70:#    - To avoid outputs dominated by degenerate all-red thin shapes, generation filters out cases with\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/11/code.py:52:#        the true output; the generator enforces this and the solver uses it as a placement filter.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/19/code.py:65:#     tie-break. Generator explicitly filters out hidden fallback-driven cases.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/13/code.py:385:    \"\"\"Generate all valid blob specs, optionally filtered by port direction, in shuffled order.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/aa4ec2a5/21/code.py:37:#      holds, so recoloring must happen for every component before any size filter is used.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e3721c99/35/code.py:177:    Divider segments are filtered out because they touch the outer border.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88bcf3b4/26/code.py:106:def _bfs_path_with_diag_filter(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88bcf3b4/26/code.py:458:    boundary = _bfs_path_with_diag_filter(entry, exit_cell, skin_walkable) or [entry]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/10/code.py:185:            raise AssertionError(\"wire trace looped in filtered pipeline\")\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/10/code.py:253:    Route endpoint tokens through a cyclic wire network whose color-9 filters may stop transmission.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/10/code.py:259:      determine whether it is an even-area pass filter or an odd-area blocker.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/10/code.py:343:# --------------- generator (filtered_cycle) ---------------\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/10/code.py:484:def _place_filter_rects(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/10/code.py:566:    rect_specs = _place_filter_rects(grid, ch_cols, allowed_mask)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/5/code.py:128:    # For side >= 5 we expect two long horizontal bars and two shorter vertical bars.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/5/code.py:180:    - The background is the most common color; every non-background component is a solid horizontal bar, vertical bar, or singleton.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88bcf3b4/8/code.py:140:def _bfs_path_with_diag_filter(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88bcf3b4/8/code.py:523:    boundary_path = _bfs_path_with_diag_filter(entry, exit_cell, skin_walkable) or [entry]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5961cc34/14/code.py:395:    \"\"\"Generate all valid blob specs, optionally filtered by port direction.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/800d221b/29/code.py:12:#   filter by connectivity-to-hub, recolor by minority, then delete only short valid branches.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e8686506/17/code.py:47:#    - Old input-orientation heuristics such as \"horizontal bar means top edge\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/aa4ec2a5/36/code.py:84:#      - Generated samples are filtered so the corner-only red count is strictly\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88bcf3b4/3/code.py:199:def _bfs_path_with_diag_filter(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88bcf3b4/3/code.py:421:        boundary_path = _bfs_path_with_diag_filter(entry, exit_cell, skin_walkable)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cb2d8a2c/29/code.py:10:     obstacle components are horizontal bars. The output is then a downward-growing green network.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cb2d8a2c/29/code.py:90:   - After canonicalization, every obstacle component is one contiguous horizontal bar.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e3721c99/28/code.py:36:#    - Every legend contains at least one tiny inner cavity, so the D8 filter is not optional noise.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e3721c99/28/code.py:49:#      size filter so divider fragments cannot be misread as legends.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88bcf3b4/7/code.py:127:def _bfs_path_with_diag_filter(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88bcf3b4/7/code.py:471:        boundary_path = _bfs_path_with_diag_filter(entry, exit_cell, skin_walkable) or [entry]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/cesh