er grid border (filters dividers).\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88bcf3b4/16/code.py:50:#       overlapping source cells are filtered and the far end is extended to preserve visible copy length\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88bcf3b4/16/code.py:144:def _bfs_path_with_diag_filter(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88bcf3b4/16/code.py:492:        boundary_path = _bfs_path_with_diag_filter(entry, exit_cell, skin_walkable) or [entry]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b0039139/29/code.py:29:#        * 1x3 horizontal bar -> keep the tile unchanged\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b0039139/29/code.py:217:    - For each ordered component, use its shape to choose the tile view: horizontal bar\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e3721c99/9/code.py:117:      - component does not touch the outer grid border (filters dividers),\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c7dc4dd/10/code.py:95:#   (use border grouping on all frames without first filtering the center\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cb2d8a2c/1/code.py:7:#   horizontal bar attached to alternating side walls, but the green trace is no longer\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cb2d8a2c/1/code.py:221:    \"\"\"Paint one canonical horizontal bar on `row`.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88bcf3b4/21/code.py:212:def _bfs_path_with_diag_filter(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e3721c99/21/code.py:104:      - not touching the outer border (filters divider lines).\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88bcf3b4/19/code.py:136:def _bfs_path_with_diag_filter(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cb2d8a2c/37/code.py:8:#      travels downward. In that view each obstacle is a floating horizontal bar.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cb2d8a2c/37/code.py:152:        assert len(rows) == 1, \"canonical obstacles must be horizontal bars\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cb2d8a2c/37/code.py:308:    - In canonical top-start view, each obstacle is a 1-cell-thick horizontal bar.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/800d221b/20/code.py:22:#   isolated decoys, so valid branches must be filtered by hub/seed contact.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c7dc4dd/6/code.py:430:    - Solving now requires two spatial judgments in sequence: filter out the middle intruder, then use the visible before/after ordering of the training pair instead of trying both directions.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cb2d8a2c/17/code.py:8:#    - Original canonical layout: 1-4 horizontal bars are spread down the main\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88bcf3b4/6/code.py:45:#      overlaps the kept source, the solver must filter those cells and extend farther along the exit direction.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88bcf3b4/6/code.py:130:def _bfs_path_with_diag_filter(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88bcf3b4/6/code.py:561:        boundary_path = _bfs_path_with_diag_filter(entry, exit_cell, skin_walkable) or [entry]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cb2d8a2c/40/code.py:32:#    horizontal bars in canonical orientation (top-start, path moving downward).\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cb2d8a2c/40/code.py:112:        assert len(rows) == 1, \"each obstacle must be a single horizontal bar\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88bcf3b4/30/code.py:112:def _bfs_path_with_diag_filter(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88bcf3b4/30/code.py:439:        boundary_path = _bfs_path_with_diag_filter(entry, exit_cell, skin_walkable) or [entry]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88bcf3b4/14/code.py:118:def _bfs_path_with_diag_filter(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88bcf3b4/14/code.py:392:        boundary_path = _bfs_path_with_diag_filter(entry, exit_cell, skin_walkable) or [entry]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/800d221b/28/code.py:32:#      constructs and filters samples to guarantee those properties.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88b