n but filters hits by structure color.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cb2d8a2c/14/code.py:8:#      travels downward. In that view every obstacle is a floating horizontal bar.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cb2d8a2c/14/code.py:74:#    - After canonicalization every obstacle component is one contiguous horizontal bar.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cb2d8a2c/14/code.py:186:        assert len(rows) == 1, \"canonical obstacles must be horizontal bars\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8b9c3697/15/code.py:24:#      Then it collects every red piece whose marker stripe has that same color. Those pieces\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/47/code.py:23:#      filtering difficulty without creating a second hidden transformation rule.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/20/code.py:93:#     - Distractors are thin blocks instead of large blobs, so they add filtering difficulty\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/2c181942/D1/1/code.py:55:#   prefilter. In the variant, components must be found from all non-bg cells outside\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b0039139/12/code.py:28:#         * 1x3 horizontal bar -> unchanged\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b0039139/12/code.py:263:    - For each component, use its shape to choose the copy transform: horizontal bar keeps\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cb2d8a2c/34/code.py:35:#    - The generator enforces a single horizontal bar in canonical top-start orientation.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cb2d8a2c/36/code.py:79:# - The selected-bar stop line is reachable while ignored bars remain solid; generator filters by\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/edb79dae/26/code.py:201:      same-color targets are filtered down to the unique nearest one before stamping.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/13/code.py:42:      - without these filters, the puzzle could look too close to the original cross/quadrant version or to an unref